<view class="workspace"><view class="workspace-head"><text class="head-title">{{event.studentName}} · {{event.level}}</text><text class="head-sub">{{event.className}} · {{event.source}}</text></view><view class="notice">请只记录完成支持工作所必需的信息，避免写入无关隐私、主观标签或未经确认的诊断。</view><view class="form-card"><text class="form-label">跟进状态</text><view class="filter-row" style="padding:0;"><view wx:for="{{statuses}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter-item {{selectedStatus === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-status="{{item}}" bindtap="selectStatus">{{item}}</view></view><text class="form-label">必要工作记录</text><textarea class="form-textarea" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：已通过学校公开渠道联系，学生表示愿意预约心理中心；不记录无关谈话内容。" bindinput="onNote"></textarea></view><view class="primary-btn" bindtap="save">保存跟进记录</view></view>
